docs(protocols): record the outcome sections of the comparison, forecasts and amplification test

The outcome sections were written on 20 and 21 November 2026, after each analysis
ran, together with a dated note of 21 November saying that the "matched" endpoint
is a trial-proxy endpoint and withdrawing a sentence that read two composites as
bounds. The text is added only; nothing earlier is changed. It was kept
uncommitted until now; this commit dates it before the public release of the code
deposit (v2.0.0).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 


